### 👁️ File Previews

Here is a quick reference of the exact file contents currently in your `/home/bob/terraform` directory:

#### `main.tf`
```hcl
resource "aws_iam_user" "john" {
  name = var.KKE_USER_NAME

  provisioner "local-exec" {
    command = "echo 'KKE ${var.KKE_USER_NAME} has been created successfully!' >> /home/bob/terraform/KKE_user_created.log"
  }
}
variables.tf
Terraform
variable "KKE_USER_NAME" {
  type        = string
  description = "Name of the AWS IAM user"
}
terraform.tfvars
Terraform
KKE_USER_NAME = "iamuser_john"
outputs.tf
Terraform
output "kke_iam_user_name" {
  value       = aws_iam_user.john.name
  description = "The name of the provisioned IAM user"
}
